    "answer": "E",
    "explanation": "(A)(D)TNBC: NAT TCb/ddAC-Pembro\nIf residual disease(WT) => capecitabine; (gBRCA) => Olaparib\nHER2 positive disease: NAT TCHP\nif residual disease => T-DM1*14\nif pCR => H +/- P * 1 yr\n(B) 根據 CTNeoBC pooled analysis,low-grade, HR positive tumor 的 pCR\nrate 最低、接著是 high grade HR tumor; TNBC 或 HER2 positive\ndisease 的 pCR rate 特別高;HER2 disease 中,又以 HR negative 和有\n加上 trastuzumab 的 subgroup pCR rate 最高\n(C) breast-conservation 或是因 comorbidites 不適合 primary surgery,可以\n先考慮 primary endocrine therapy 試著 down-staging\n(D)HER2+ EBC: NAT 處方 TCHP or AC-THP,然後根據 pathology\npCR => H+/-P* 1 yr\nresidual invasive disease => T-DM1*14\nTNBC: TCa/AC + Pembro,然後根據 pathology\n\npCR => complete one year Pembro or OBS\nresidual invasive disease => capecitabine\n(E) 根據 the CTNeoBC pooled analysis 以及 NSABP B-18/NSABP B-27\ntrial,有 pCR 的人比沒有 pCR 的人 survival 較高,這樣的 prognotic value\n在 TNBC(OS HR 0.16, 95% CI 0.11-0.25)或 HER2 positive diseaser(OS HR\n0.08, 95% CI 0.03-0.22)最明顯\nref: Lancet. 2014 Jul 12;384(9938):164-72",
