    "topic": "target therapy",
    "trials": [],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "(A) Correct: 根據 Cell. 2011;144(5):646-674. 原文,『...for example,\nthe one responding to the Ras signal transducer, may only recapitulate\na subset of the regulatory instructions transmitted by an activated\nreceptor.』而 sotorasib 則是 KRAS G12C mutation 的 inhibitor。\n(B)Incorrect: In addition to the hallmark capability of inducing and\nsustaining positively acting growth-stimulatory signals, cancer\ncells must also circumvent powerful programs that negatively\nregulate cell proliferation; many of these programs depend on the\nactions of tumor suppressor genes. 內文與 olaparib 機轉關係不\n大。\n(C)Correct: venectoclax allows hematologic cancer cells to evade\napoptosis\n(D)Correct: bevacizumab binds to VEGF 正是針對腫瘤 inducing\nangiogenesis 的機轉作用。\n(E)Correct: ipilimumab as an immune checkpoint inhibitor 就是針\n對免疫逃脫的原理。",
