    "answer": "D",
    "explanation": "(D) 錯誤,FGFR2 fusion 為 Cholangiocarcinoma 的生物標記。\n應該是 FGFR2 amplification 才是 Gastric cancer 的生物標記。\nFGFR2 amplifications are observed in approximately 5% of G/GEJ cancers, are enriched in the\nCIN and GS subtypes, and might be associated with poor prognosis.\nReference: Biomarker-targeted therapies for advanced-stage gastric and gastro-oesophageal\njunction cancers: an emerging paradigm. Nat Rev Clin Oncol. 2021 Aug;18(8):473-487.\n(A), (C), (E) 正確,如 NCCN guideline。\n(B) 正確,Claudin 18.2 overexpression 可用來偵測 gastric cancer。\nThe gap junction protein claudin 18.2, overexpressed in the majority of gastric cancers, has\nemerged as novel and actionable target. The antibody zolbetuximab, targeting claudin 18.2 and\npotentially augmenting antibody-dependent cellular cytotoxicity, was studied in a recent\nrandomized phase 2 trial comparing chemotherapy with EOX with or without zolbetuximab in\npaitents testing positive by IHC for claudin 18.2. Of 730 patients screened, 161 (22%) tested\npositive for claudin 18.2 and were treated. With the addition of zolbetuximab improvements were\nseen in progression- free survival (7.5 vs 5.3 months, HR 0.44, P <.0005) and overall survival\n(13.0 vs 10.2 months, HR 0.55, P <0.0005), with benefits limited to patients with high expression\nof claudin 18.2 (≥70% of tumor cells). Phase 3 trials are ongoing.\nReference: DeVita_practice of oncology, 12e, p.474",
