    "explanation": "Option (1): 根據 ABC-02 study，轉移性膽管癌第一線標準化學治療是 gemcitabine + oxaliplatin\nClinical Status: 錯誤。\nKey Guideline Recommendation: Advanced / metastatic biliary tract cancer 的傳統一線 backbone 是 gemcitabine + cisplatin (GemCis)，現在多半是在此 backbone 上加上 durvalumab 或 pembrolizumab。\nAssociated Clinical Trial(s):\nABC-02, Phase III\nPopulation: Unresectable locally advanced or metastatic biliary tract cancer，包括 cholangiocarcinoma、gallbladder cancer、ampullary cancer。\nMethod / Design: gemcitabine + cisplatin vs gemcitabine alone。\nResults: GemCis 相較 gemcitabine alone 顯著改善 OS；PubMed 結論指出 cisplatin plus gemcitabine 帶來 survival advantage，且未增加 substantial toxicity。\nClinical Impact: ABC-02 建立的是 gemcitabine + cisplatin，不是 gemcitabine + oxaliplatin。\n\n考點句：\n看到 ABC-02 = GemCis；看到 GemOx 通常是 alternative regimen，不是 ABC-02 標準答案。\n\nOption (2): 根據 JCOG1202，gemcitabine + S-1 優於 gemcitabine，所以 gemcitabine + S-1 是日本目前標準化學治療\nClinical Status: 錯誤，敘述混淆 trial。\nKey Guideline Recommendation: 日本研究確實支持 gemcitabine + S-1 (GS) 可作為 advanced BTC 的一線選項之一，但依據主要是 JCOG1113 / FUGA-BT，不是 JCOG1202。\nAssociated Clinical Trial(s):\nJCOG1202 / ASCOT, Phase III\nPopulation: Curatively resected biliary tract cancer，不是 metastatic disease。\nMethod / Design: Adjuvant S-1 vs observation。\nResults: Adjuvant S-1 改善 OS；3-year OS 77.1% vs 67.6%。\nClinical Impact: 這是 術後輔助治療 adjuvant setting，不是 metastatic first-line chemotherapy；也不是 gemcitabine + S-1 vs gemcitabine。\nJCOG1113 / FUGA-BT, Phase III\nPopulation: Advanced biliary tract cancer。\nMethod / Design: gemcitabine + S-1 (GS) vs gemcitabine + cisplatin (GC)。\nResults / Impact: 研究目標是證明 GS 對 GC 的 non-inferiority；文獻摘要明確指出當時 GC 是 chemo-naïve unresectable or recurrent BTC 的 standard treatment，而 JCOG1113 是比較 GS 是否不劣於 GC。\n\n考點句：\n「GS 在日本是可接受一線選項」這句可以成立；但「根據 JCOG1202、GS 優於 gemcitabine」是錯的。\n\nOption (3): 轉移性膽管癌標準第二線化學治療是 liposomal irinotecan + 5-FU\nClinical Status: 不精確，考試上多半判錯。\nKey Guideline Recommendation: 若無 actionable mutation，經 GemCis-based therapy 後的傳統 second-line chemotherapy 標準證據是 FOLFOX；liposomal irinotecan + 5-FU/LV 是後線治療選項之一，但不是唯一或最經典的 standard。\nAssociated Clinical Trial(s):\nABC-06, Phase III\nPopulation: Advanced biliary tract cancer，progression after cisplatin + gemcitabine，且 performance status 尚可。\nMethod / Design: Active symptom control alone vs active symptom control + FOLFOX。\nResults: FOLFOX 加入 active symptom control 改善 median OS；Lancet Oncology/PubMed 結論指出 FOLFOX 帶來 clinically meaningful improvement in 6-month and 12-month OS rates。\nClinical Impact: FOLFOX 是 second-line BTC 最重要的 phase III evidence-based chemotherapy standard。\nNIFTY, Phase IIb\nPopulation: Advanced BTC after progression on first-line gemcitabine + cisplatin。\nMethod / Design: liposomal irinotecan + 5-FU/LV vs 5-FU/LV。\nResults: NIFTY 顯示 PFS benefit；JAMA Oncology updated analysis 提到 primary endpoint met，PFS HR 0.56, 95% CI 0.39–0.81, P = .002。\nClinical Impact: 支持 liposomal irinotecan + 5-FU/LV 作為 option；但另一個 NALIRICC trial 未達主要 endpoint，未改善 PFS 或 OS，且 toxicity 增加。\n\n考點句：\nSecond-line BTC：ABC-06 = FOLFOX。\nnal-IRI + 5-FU/LV = reasonable option / subsequent-line option，但若題目問「標準第二線化學治療」通常首選 FOLFOX。\n\nOption (4): 近年臨床試驗已證實 checkpoint inhibitor 在膽道癌第一線療效，包括 pembrolizumab 或 durvalumab + chemotherapy，可延長 OS\nClinical Status: 正確。\nKey Guideline Recommendation: 目前 advanced / metastatic BTC 一線標準已進入 GemCis + immune checkpoint inhibitor 時代。ESMO Pan-Asian adapted guideline 明確建議 first-line treatment 為 cisplatin–gemcitabine plus either durvalumab or pembrolizumab。\nAssociated Clinical Trial(s):\nTOPAZ-1, Phase III\nPopulation: Unresectable locally advanced or metastatic biliary tract cancer，first-line。\nMethod / Design: durvalumab + gemcitabine/cisplatin vs placebo + gemcitabine/cisplatin。\nResults: Durvalumab + GemCis 顯著改善 OS；ESMO Daily Reporter 報告 OS rates：12 months 54.3% vs 47.1%，18 months 34.8% vs 24.1%，24 months 23.6% vs 11.5%。\nClinical Impact: 建立 durvalumab + GemCis 為 advanced BTC first-line standard。\nKEYNOTE-966, Phase III\nPopulation: Untreated unresectable locally advanced or metastatic biliary tract cancer。\nMethod / Design: pembrolizumab + gemcitabine/cisplatin vs placebo + gemcitabine/cisplatin。\nResults: Median OS 12.7 vs 10.9 months；HR 0.83, 95% CI 0.72–0.95, one-sided P = .0034。\nClinical Impact: 證實 pembrolizumab + GemCis 也可改善 OS，成為一線治療選項。\n最終考點總結\n\nMetastatic biliary tract cancer：\n\n一線核心：\ndurvalumab + gemcitabine/cisplatin 或 pembrolizumab + gemcitabine/cisplatin。\n\n傳統 chemotherapy backbone：\nABC-02 = gemcitabine + cisplatin，不是 oxaliplatin。\n\n日本 GS 相關考點：\nJCOG1113 = gemcitabine + S-1 non-inferior to GemCis；\nJCOG1202 = adjuvant S-1 vs observation after resection。\n\n二線 chemotherapy：\nABC-06 = FOLFOX 是最重要 phase III evidence；\nliposomal irinotecan + 5-FU/LV 是可考慮選項，但不是最標準答案。\n\n本題答案： (4)。",
