    "answer": "E",
    "explanation": "## 答案：**E（1）（2）（3）（4）**\n\n這題考的是 **cell death modality 與 immunogenicity** 的基本分類：\n**Apoptosis = usually non-immunogenic / immunologically silent**；\n**Necroptosis、Pyroptosis = inflammatory / immunogenic cell death**。\n\n---\n\n# 題目考點\n\n| Cell death type | Membrane integrity                 | DAMP release | Immunogenicity          |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------- |\n| **Apoptosis**   | Mostly preserved                   | Minimal      | Usually non-immunogenic |\n| **Necroptosis** | Rupture / necrotic morphology      | Yes          | Immunogenic             |\n| **Pyroptosis**  | Gasdermin pore formation → rupture | Yes          | Immunogenic             |\n\n---\n\n# 選項解析\n\n## (1) Apoptosis：細胞縮小、被鄰近細胞吞噬，通常 non-immunogenic ✅\n\n正確。\n\n**Apoptosis** 的典型特徵：\n\n* Cell shrinkage\n* Chromatin condensation\n* Membrane blebbing\n* Apoptotic bodies\n* Rapid efferocytosis by macrophages or neighboring cells\n* 通常不造成明顯 DAMP release\n\n因此傳統上被視為：\n\n> **immunologically silent cell death**\n\n不過 board-level nuance 是：某些 treatment-induced apoptosis 可以變成 **immunogenic apoptosis**，例如 chemotherapy / radiotherapy induced calreticulin exposure、ATP release、HMGB1 release。但本題描述的是典型 apoptosis，因此正確。\n\n---\n\n## (2) Necroptosis：細胞腫脹、破裂、釋放內容物，immunogenic ✅\n\n正確。\n\n**Necroptosis** 是 regulated necrotic cell death，常與：\n\n* RIPK1\n* RIPK3\n* MLKL\n\n相關。\n\n典型表現：\n\n* Cell swelling\n* Plasma membrane rupture\n* Intracellular content release\n* DAMP release\n\n所以會促進 local inflammation，是 **immunogenic cell death**。\n\n---\n\n## (3) Pyroptosis：形成 pores、膜破裂、釋放 cytokines 與 DAMPs，immunogenic ✅\n\n正確。\n\n**Pyroptosis** 是 inflammatory programmed cell death，常與：\n\n* Inflammasome activation\n* Caspase-1 或 caspase-4/5/11\n* Gasdermin D pore formation\n\n相關。\n\n釋放：\n\n* IL-1β\n* IL-18\n* DAMPs\n\n因此高度 inflammatory / immunogenic。\n\n---\n\n## (4) Apoptosis 不釋放 proinflammatory signals；necroptosis / pyroptosis 會釋放 proinflammatory molecules ✅\n\n正確。\n\n這是本題核心比較：\n\n| Feature           | Apoptosis      | Necroptosis | Pyroptosis                    |\n| ----------------- | -------------- | ----------- | ----------------------------- |\n| Inflammatory      | No / low       | Yes         | Yes                           |\n| DAMP release      | Minimal        | Yes         | Yes                           |\n| Cytokine release  | No / low       | Indirect    | Yes, especially IL-1β / IL-18 |\n| Immune activation | Usually silent | Strong      | Strong                        |\n\n---\n\n# Common Trap\n\n### Trap 1：Apoptosis 永遠 non-immunogenic？\n\n考試通常把 apoptosis 視為 **non-immunogenic**。\n但現代腫瘤免疫學要知道：\n\n> Apoptosis can become immunogenic if accompanied by DAMPs such as calreticulin exposure, ATP release, and HMGB1 release.\n\n不過這不是本題想考的層次。\n\n---\n\n### Trap 2：Necroptosis vs Pyroptosis\n\n| Type            | Key pathway                        | Board keyword       |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Necroptosis** | RIPK1 / RIPK3 / MLKL               | Regulated necrosis  |\n| **Pyroptosis**  | Inflammasome / caspase / gasdermin | IL-1β, IL-18, pores |\n\n---\n\n# 一句話記憶\n\n> **Apoptosis = silent death；Necroptosis and Pyroptosis = inflammatory death with DAMP release.**\n\n因此正確答案是：\n\n## **E（1）（2）（3）（4）**",
